      "html": "<p><code class=\"command\">INSERT</code> with an <code class=\"literal\">ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE</code> clause behaves similarly. In Read Committed mode, each row proposed for insertion will either insert or update. Unless there are unrelated errors, one of those two outcomes is guaranteed. If a conflict originates in another transaction whose effects are not yet visible to the <code class=\"command\">INSERT</code>, the <code class=\"command\">UPDATE</code> clause will affect that row, even though possibly <span class=\"emphasis\"><em>no</em></span> version of that row is conventionally visible to the command.</p>",
